# osTicket Help Desk Lab

A hands-on IT support lab documenting the installation, configuration,
and troubleshooting of osTicket on an Ubuntu Server virtual machine.

## Environment

- Hypervisor: Oracle VirtualBox
- Operating System: Ubuntu Server
- Web Server: Apache
- Scripting Language: PHP
- Database: MariaDB
- Help Desk Platform: osTicket

